# Vercel CLI upload filter. When this file exists, Vercel uses IT instead of
# falling back to .gitignore — which is the whole point: .gitignore excludes the
# large survival-journey artifacts (public/backtest/survival_journey*.json), but
# the deployed /survival page NEEDS them. By NOT listing them here, they upload.
#
# Exclude only what the build regenerates or shouldn't ship:
node_modules
.next
.git
.vercel
*.log
# Local test/coverage noise:
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
